      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIX DOLPHINS (8) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors four starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (35.04) at this track over 600m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. HOOKED ON DOLLY (5) had been super consistent recording two placings in a row before she was rewarded with a win last time, scoring at this track over 600m (34.51). Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. VICTORY EXAM (7) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Ethan's Brother (30.31) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature. NARINGAL BOY (2) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
